# Build context of every image built from the repository root: an allow-list of
# what those images COPY. Everything else (.venv, .git, tests, docs, .superpowers,
# forks, deploy/ with its inventories) stays out of the context.
#
# * control-plane image (deploy/compose/control.Dockerfile): pyproject.toml,
#   uv.lock, control/. Its own control.Dockerfile.dockerignore is narrower and
#   wins under BuildKit; this file is the fallback for builders that ignore it.
# * lab-cell image (cell/Dockerfile, Task 14b): also cell/ and agents/.
# Add a path here only together with the COPY that needs it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!control/
!cell/
!agents/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
